OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of baby
OL,4,Afound stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the death of
OL,7,Fa newborn baby who was found at a house
OL,8,Fin Sheffield.
OL,10,FMaria Skopova - previously referred to
OL,11,Fas Baby S in court - suffered 33 wounds
OL,12,Ffrom 15 separate stabbings and died on
OL,13,Fthe day of her birth in Holywell
OL,14,FHeights, in the Wincobank area of the
OL,15,Fcity, on 30 August.
OL,17,FSenior coroner Tanyka Rawden told
OL,18,FSheffield's Medico-Legal Centre that
OL,19,Fshe was adjourning the inquest until 25
OL,20,FMarch while there were ongoing criminal
OL,21,Fproceedings.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
